        "eyebrow": "built for the streets",
        "title": "Born in the Underground, Made for the Culture",
        "body_1": "Rawblox was founded in 2021 by a group of skaters, artists, and designers tired of mass-produced, soul-less fast fashion. We wanted clothes that told a story—our story.",
